# <FILE>target/linux/bcm4908/patches-6.12/406-rt-ac86u-zone-led-display.patch</FILE> - <DESC>Four-zone counted-pulse boot and panic LED display.</DESC>
# <VERS>VERSION: 0.1.1</VERS>
# <WCTX>Display boot zones without binary decoding or scheduling during panic.</WCTX>
# <CLOG>Add polled zone pulses, persistent WAN anchor, guarded userspace steps and panic replay.</CLOG>

